<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 27.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northampton and Oxfordshire Jun 111.50 Jul 113.5o</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Lincolnshire Jun 89.00</p>
<p>South Humberside May 89.00 Jun 90.00 Jul 92.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jun 94.00</p>
<p>Herefordshire Jun 89.50 Jul 92.00</p>
<p>Hampshire May 90.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 97.00</p>
<p>Tilbury May 89.00 Jun 89.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Yorkshire Jul 92.50</p>
</text>
